WEBVTT

01:33.440 --> 01:35.410
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.481 --> 01:37.910
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:37.981 --> 01:40.851
(Episode 34)

01:43.451 --> 01:44.951
Did he say anything?

01:47.491 --> 01:49.520
What could he say?

01:52.190 --> 01:54.160
He already couldn't make it in the car.

01:55.961 --> 01:56.800
He said it hurts.

01:57.830 --> 01:59.131
He said he was in pain.

02:01.541 --> 02:03.270
He didn't say anything else.

02:07.170 --> 02:07.940
Chief.

02:10.241 --> 02:12.181
How are we going to answer to his parents?

02:16.050 --> 02:19.321
How are we going to answer to his parents?

02:52.451 --> 02:53.120
Song Yan.

03:20.311 --> 03:21.251
Song Yan.

03:26.050 --> 03:27.020
Song Yan!

03:32.261 --> 03:33.360
Are you okay?

03:42.400 --> 03:43.340
Xu Qin.

03:46.541 --> 03:48.381
I don't think I can promise you anymore.

03:53.911 --> 03:54.811
What's wrong?

04:01.050 --> 04:02.620
I can't let him die in vain,

04:04.321 --> 04:05.761
no matter what it takes.

04:12.300 --> 04:13.531
There might be changes...

04:15.740 --> 04:16.941
to what I promised you.

04:20.270 --> 04:21.941
You can say that I go back on my word...

04:23.281 --> 04:24.410
and I am irresponsible.

04:25.381 --> 04:26.580
That I lied to you.

04:26.881 --> 04:28.051
Don't say that.

04:29.480 --> 04:30.850
Song Yan, don't say that.

04:41.600 --> 04:42.530
Are you disappointed?

04:51.201 --> 04:52.470
Is this how life is?

04:58.881 --> 05:01.080
This is how life is with me.

06:10.280 --> 06:11.080
Chief.

06:12.220 --> 06:13.090
Help me.

07:04.501 --> 07:07.270
(Shilitai Fire Station History Museum)

07:36.001 --> 07:39.270
(Firefighter)

08:11.640 --> 08:12.540
I've checked.

08:13.941 --> 08:15.480
It wasn't an accident.

08:17.611 --> 08:19.710
Do you know who owns that building?

08:19.980 --> 08:21.381
I don't care who owns it.

08:22.480 --> 08:23.621
Those scums...

08:24.251 --> 08:25.350
risked lives...

08:25.421 --> 08:27.251
just to save a few million on a multi-million yuan project.

08:27.321 --> 08:28.350
Guokun Group...

08:29.821 --> 08:30.660
belongs to the Meng family.

08:33.330 --> 08:35.301
The news about non-compliance with fireworks and firecrackers...

08:38.230 --> 08:40.431
is all over the Internet.

08:41.801 --> 08:43.441
Together with our report,

08:44.740 --> 08:46.610
Guokun Group will be in big trouble.

08:55.580 --> 08:58.181
(Zhan Da Peng, First Merit)

09:05.791 --> 09:07.090
The sky won't collapse.

09:15.740 --> 09:16.840
Three people died.

09:17.470 --> 09:19.340
One of them was a firefighter.

09:19.941 --> 09:22.240
It's all over the Internet now.

09:23.240 --> 09:24.181
Things on the Internet...

09:24.240 --> 09:25.710
go as quickly as they come.

09:26.010 --> 09:27.281
They're all bandwagoners.

09:27.480 --> 09:28.651
But I still find this incident...

09:29.021 --> 09:30.850
rather strange.

09:31.321 --> 09:33.620
Mr. Gu pays attention to quality.

09:34.521 --> 09:36.291
Why would he make a junior mistake...

09:36.421 --> 09:37.821
on this matter?

09:42.201 --> 09:43.960
Mr. Meng, the driver is here.

09:45.630 --> 09:46.571
Don't worry.

09:47.100 --> 09:48.431
Tell Mr. Gu's people...

09:48.771 --> 09:50.041
to take care of it.

09:50.441 --> 09:52.141
Talk to the right people.

09:53.071 --> 09:54.470
Do some PR.

09:56.681 --> 09:58.311
Problems that can be solved with money...

09:59.110 --> 10:00.110
are not problems.

10:01.510 --> 10:02.480
I'll do it myself.

10:02.651 --> 10:03.451
See you.

10:05.220 --> 10:05.891
Your phone.

10:07.951 --> 10:08.691
You.

10:10.291 --> 10:11.321
Don't worry too much.

10:21.201 --> 10:22.370
- Sir, please leave. - I...

10:22.571 --> 10:23.271
Please leave.

10:23.340 --> 10:24.701
- You can't go in. - Please leave.

10:25.041 --> 10:26.071
Who are you?

10:27.041 --> 10:29.141
Some of our colleagues are injured at work.

10:29.210 --> 10:30.541
I'm representing the company...

10:30.610 --> 10:31.811
to visit them.

10:32.010 --> 10:33.210
This is the emergency room.

10:33.311 --> 10:34.110
Visitors are not allowed.

10:35.681 --> 10:37.181
We have something very important...

10:37.250 --> 10:38.250
that we need to discuss...

10:38.321 --> 10:39.590
with our injured colleagues.

10:39.651 --> 10:42.090
Also, I've already talked to your hospital's Mr. Liu.

10:42.161 --> 10:43.321
It won't take long.

10:43.860 --> 10:45.391
There are rules in the emergency room.

10:45.460 --> 10:46.590
No one is allowed in.

10:46.760 --> 10:47.590
Miss.

10:47.960 --> 10:48.931
How about this?

10:49.531 --> 10:51.360
Call your superior to confirm it.

10:51.431 --> 10:52.171
I'm busy.

10:52.230 --> 10:53.571
The patients' dressings are waiting to be changed.

10:53.801 --> 10:54.630
Let's go.

10:57.240 --> 10:58.710
This is the message from Mr. Liu.

10:58.771 --> 10:59.470
Read it yourself.

11:03.141 --> 11:03.811
Leave.

11:03.880 --> 11:04.740
Dr. Xu.

11:06.451 --> 11:07.380
Your superior...

11:12.220 --> 11:12.921
All right.

11:14.120 --> 11:15.291
We'll come back...

11:15.360 --> 11:16.090
at a more convenient time.

11:17.590 --> 11:18.460
Ms. Meng.

11:20.691 --> 11:21.460
I am Mr. Wang,

11:21.730 --> 11:23.330
Mr. Gu's secretary.

11:23.730 --> 11:25.870
I paid a visit to your house with Mr. Gu.

11:25.931 --> 11:26.771
We've met before.

11:27.201 --> 11:28.130
I'm sorry.

11:28.201 --> 11:29.201
I don't remember much.

11:30.801 --> 11:31.600
It's okay.

11:33.671 --> 11:34.470
Ms. Meng.

11:34.970 --> 11:35.781
Mr. Wu?

11:35.941 --> 11:36.740
Here's the thing.

11:36.840 --> 11:37.880
These injured workers...

11:37.941 --> 11:39.681
are from the same project of our company.

11:40.411 --> 11:41.181
Mr. Wang and I are here...

11:41.250 --> 11:42.380
to understand the situation.

11:42.651 --> 11:44.120
Could you arrange for us to meet as soon as possible?

11:46.421 --> 11:47.850
The site where the fireworks caught fire...

11:47.921 --> 11:49.021
belongs to Guokun?

11:50.791 --> 11:51.521
Yes.

11:52.260 --> 11:53.330
It was an accident.

11:53.561 --> 11:54.791
Since this happened,

11:55.061 --> 11:56.130
we're all very anxious.

11:56.531 --> 11:57.730
We hope that you...

11:58.771 --> 12:00.531
can help us make the arrangements.

12:03.370 --> 12:04.701
(Work together to eliminate fire hazards)

12:04.771 --> 12:05.870
(Participate in building a safe society)

12:16.350 --> 12:19.850
(Zhan Da Peng)

12:27.391 --> 12:28.191
Ma'am.

12:29.460 --> 12:30.801
Da Peng left this.

12:50.321 --> 12:51.521
Dear Old Zhan...

12:52.051 --> 12:53.051
and Madam Hua.

12:54.090 --> 12:56.391
I won't be able to go home this Lunar New Year...

12:56.460 --> 12:57.661
and spend it with you.

12:58.521 --> 13:00.990
I know you must miss me.

13:01.561 --> 13:02.401
I miss you too.

13:03.661 --> 13:04.901
There are a lot of firefighters who haven't been home...

13:04.960 --> 13:06.630
for about six years for the Lunar New Year.

13:07.100 --> 13:08.500
You'll have to get used to me...

13:08.571 --> 13:09.541
not being around.

13:10.340 --> 13:11.141
Right.

13:11.470 --> 13:12.970
I have good news for you.

13:13.240 --> 13:15.041
I went into the fire to carry out my mission.

13:15.980 --> 13:18.041
The real fire is nothing like...

13:18.110 --> 13:19.781
the fire I imagined.

13:20.010 --> 13:21.480
It's way hotter.

13:22.051 --> 13:23.880
I couldn't see anything clearly.

13:24.421 --> 13:25.220
But...

13:25.321 --> 13:27.250
you don't have to worry about your son.

13:27.551 --> 13:29.321
It's because I'm amazing.

13:29.891 --> 13:31.590
I got first place in the evaluation.

13:32.061 --> 13:33.531
Our station got first place too...

13:33.590 --> 13:34.760
in the city's martial arts competition.

13:34.891 --> 13:36.130
We were so cool.

13:40.600 --> 13:41.370
Mom.

13:41.431 --> 13:42.901
He's our chief, Mr. Song.

13:42.970 --> 13:43.941
He's awesome.

13:44.201 --> 13:45.541
But in the future, your son...

13:45.811 --> 13:46.740
will be even more awesome.

13:50.980 --> 13:52.980
There's one more piece of good news that I want to tell you.

13:53.980 --> 13:55.521
I'm seeing someone.

13:56.380 --> 13:57.220
She's great.

13:57.480 --> 13:58.451
When the time comes,

13:58.850 --> 14:00.551
I'll bring her home to meet you.

14:02.460 --> 14:03.561
Handsome me.

14:04.321 --> 14:06.130
Beautiful Li Nan.

14:11.100 --> 14:11.960
I can't cry.

14:15.201 --> 14:17.340
Da Peng wouldn't want me to be sad.

14:17.401 --> 14:18.470
But he...

14:20.970 --> 14:22.181
My heart...

14:23.541 --> 14:25.210
It hurts so much.

15:09.661 --> 15:10.561
Da Peng.

15:13.931 --> 15:15.531
Were you in a lot of pain...

15:18.230 --> 15:20.901
at the end?

16:05.541 --> 16:09.551
(Zhan Da Peng)

16:19.931 --> 16:20.590
What's wrong?

16:21.230 --> 16:21.931
Yang Chi.

16:22.531 --> 16:23.401
- Yang Chi. - What's wrong?

16:24.931 --> 16:25.771
What's wrong?

16:28.600 --> 16:29.441
Instructor.

16:30.740 --> 16:32.201
File this in time for future reference.

16:32.271 --> 16:33.470
- Okay. - Instructor.

16:33.941 --> 16:35.041
Look at this comment.

16:35.240 --> 16:36.380
It says the victims were killed...

16:36.441 --> 16:37.610
because the fire department were improperly commanded...

16:37.681 --> 16:39.080
and misjudged the fire.

16:39.151 --> 16:39.850
And this one.

16:39.911 --> 16:40.880
It's even weirder.

16:41.010 --> 16:42.821
It says the firefighter who died was too young...

16:42.880 --> 16:43.781
and inexperienced.

16:43.980 --> 16:44.821
What the heck?

16:44.880 --> 16:46.451
That's enough. Ignore these haters.

16:47.051 --> 16:48.220
Yes, I can ignore them.

16:48.850 --> 16:50.421
One or two lunatics are fine.

16:50.720 --> 16:52.090
But the comments about the fire?

16:52.161 --> 16:53.061
Keep reading.

16:53.791 --> 16:54.691
There are comments like this...

16:54.760 --> 16:55.701
with so many likes.

16:55.760 --> 16:57.301
Yang Chi, calm down.

16:57.561 --> 16:58.960
They're most probably not real comments.

16:59.031 --> 17:00.071
They must be trolls hired...

17:00.130 --> 17:00.830
to create a ruckus.

17:00.901 --> 17:02.171
What trolls?

17:02.541 --> 17:04.340
Don't we know how Da Peng was sacrificed?

17:04.401 --> 17:05.370
We all know.

17:05.970 --> 17:08.041
Can't the higher-ups make a statement?

17:08.541 --> 17:10.010
Why are they letting these trolls troll us like this?

17:10.080 --> 17:11.281
The investigation is ongoing.

17:12.181 --> 17:13.681
The result will be out soon.

17:14.381 --> 17:15.050
Let's not panic.

17:15.681 --> 17:16.851
We have to believe in the organization.

17:17.681 --> 17:19.220
Trust the eyes of the public.

17:19.851 --> 17:21.320
The innocent won't be guilty.

17:22.091 --> 17:22.820
Justice...

17:23.421 --> 17:24.621
won't be buried.

17:25.861 --> 17:26.631
- Yes. - Yes.

17:26.790 --> 17:28.661
You're right. We understand the logic.

17:28.931 --> 17:30.730
- But when I look at this... - Then don't look at it.

17:34.901 --> 17:35.841
Let's go back first.

17:44.710 --> 17:47.510
(Report regarding the fire at Guokun Group's Junguang Square)

18:01.861 --> 18:02.601
See this?

18:03.460 --> 18:04.960
It's the third call today.

18:05.230 --> 18:06.701
Each one is more powerful than the last.

18:07.131 --> 18:09.441
They all told me not to make a big deal...

18:09.601 --> 18:11.570
and not to mention the fire safety...

18:11.641 --> 18:13.371
or the insulation.

18:13.441 --> 18:15.141
They want us to mind our own business.

18:15.941 --> 18:17.411
They think as long as there's money.

18:18.010 --> 18:18.911
They can do anything.

18:23.621 --> 18:25.250
You should be careful too. Even a worm will turn.

18:26.621 --> 18:27.651
I'm not afraid of anything.

18:28.121 --> 18:29.161
We made a deal.

18:29.720 --> 18:30.520
This report,

18:31.091 --> 18:32.161
we'll sign it together.

18:41.030 --> 18:42.131
Have you thought about Xu Qin?

18:51.810 --> 18:52.980
Before I was with her,

18:54.611 --> 18:56.050
I felt like I could give her everything.

18:57.451 --> 18:58.621
Now that we're together, I realize...

18:59.621 --> 19:00.820
that I haven't given her anything.

19:04.320 --> 19:05.320
Actually, I'm afraid...

19:07.490 --> 19:08.560
that I would owe her.

19:11.000 --> 19:11.800
I'm also afraid...

19:13.431 --> 19:15.030
that I know I'd owe her,

19:17.770 --> 19:18.671
but I still want to.

19:44.601 --> 19:45.401
Are you okay?

19:51.141 --> 19:51.841
Dr. Xu.

19:53.871 --> 19:55.070
I regret it.

19:58.841 --> 19:59.710
Regret what?

20:00.911 --> 20:02.081
That day,

20:03.280 --> 20:05.520
if I hadn't said those things to him,

20:09.091 --> 20:10.921
if I had gone to the movies...

20:13.391 --> 20:14.730
or had a meal with him,

20:18.460 --> 20:20.201
maybe things wouldn't have been like this.

20:23.601 --> 20:26.641
How could that be the last time I saw him?

20:28.970 --> 20:31.810
Why was it the last time I saw him?

20:56.500 --> 20:57.371
I have to get back,

20:57.740 --> 20:58.941
so I'll keep it short.

20:59.641 --> 21:01.010
This fire is especially serious.

21:01.611 --> 21:02.681
Part of the reason...

21:02.740 --> 21:04.411
is the fire station found a loophole.

21:04.780 --> 21:06.510
But the greater responsibility lies with the owner of the site.

21:07.010 --> 21:07.851
That is...

21:09.111 --> 21:10.050
Meng family's Guokun Group.

21:10.921 --> 21:12.020
I never get involved...

21:12.520 --> 21:13.651
with the family business.

21:13.921 --> 21:15.720
Based on the investigation I've done so far,

21:17.220 --> 21:18.260
the situation doesn't look good for them.

21:20.790 --> 21:21.960
How are you going to handle it?

21:23.701 --> 21:24.530
I'll tell the truth.

21:25.901 --> 21:27.171
That's your responsibility.

21:27.901 --> 21:29.101
I have nothing to say.

21:36.240 --> 21:37.480
A lot of people came to talk to me...

21:37.980 --> 21:39.381
and told me not to trouble others...

21:39.510 --> 21:40.980
nor make trouble for myself.

21:41.851 --> 21:43.520
That I should turn a blind eye.

21:44.050 --> 21:44.980
Can you do that?

21:50.121 --> 21:50.960
You can't.

21:52.520 --> 21:53.560
There's a line you can't cross.

21:54.091 --> 21:55.161
Once you step over it,

21:55.290 --> 21:56.601
it'll all go downhill.

21:58.601 --> 21:59.831
What happens after that...

22:00.171 --> 22:02.201
won't go the way you first imagined.

22:02.530 --> 22:03.540
Because people...

22:04.570 --> 22:05.641
are just animals...

22:05.701 --> 22:07.371
that keep making excuses for themselves.

22:08.040 --> 22:09.270
When you take that first step...

22:09.641 --> 22:11.510
to go against your original intention,

22:12.851 --> 22:14.510
your original intention will never return.

22:25.361 --> 22:26.091
What's wrong?

22:28.691 --> 22:29.500
Nothing.

22:30.931 --> 22:32.361
I think you're really nice.

22:36.300 --> 22:37.371
I'm not that nice.

22:38.570 --> 22:39.371
Actually,

22:41.141 --> 22:42.611
I'm a little selfish too.

22:43.941 --> 22:44.710
For example?

22:45.081 --> 22:46.210
For example, I also wonder...

22:48.010 --> 22:49.210
if you'll betray your principles...

22:50.050 --> 22:51.220
for me.

22:52.220 --> 22:53.691
You don't have to do it.

22:56.921 --> 22:57.790
But it feels like...

22:58.661 --> 22:59.891
if you do,

23:00.730 --> 23:02.131
it would prove something.

23:15.570 --> 23:16.581
But Da Peng...

23:17.381 --> 23:19.081
died at such a young age.

23:19.911 --> 23:21.780
If you had ignored the victim...

23:22.050 --> 23:22.980
and you didn't care about the truth,

23:24.851 --> 23:26.621
you would've been horrible.

23:28.151 --> 23:29.720
That's not the person I like.

23:33.760 --> 23:35.191
There's a lot at stake in this incident.

23:35.931 --> 23:36.901
It's complicated.

23:38.661 --> 23:39.530
If it's not handled well,

23:40.901 --> 23:42.030
my promise to you...

23:43.941 --> 23:44.740
might...

23:48.010 --> 23:49.371
I know you have to do the right thing.

23:51.181 --> 23:52.181
But it's so hard.

23:54.181 --> 23:55.210
I can't imagine...

23:57.381 --> 23:58.451
what will happen to my family.

24:00.621 --> 24:02.760
Nor can I imagine what will happen to you.

24:04.861 --> 24:05.891
Your career.

24:06.990 --> 24:07.931
Your future.

24:10.460 --> 24:11.661
Our future.

24:13.371 --> 24:14.401
Just thinking about it...

24:15.431 --> 24:16.641
suffocates me.

24:27.611 --> 24:28.381
I'm sorry.

24:30.020 --> 24:31.451
I shouldn't have dragged you into this.

24:33.520 --> 24:35.250
We've worked so hard all this time.

24:36.760 --> 24:39.191
But why do accidents and obstacles keep happening?

24:41.490 --> 24:42.730
The future will be fine, right?

24:43.300 --> 24:44.000
Song Yan.

24:44.701 --> 24:45.560
It will be fine, right?

24:51.101 --> 24:51.901
I'm sorry.

24:53.411 --> 24:54.240
It's okay.

24:56.210 --> 24:57.441
I'm just sad.

24:57.980 --> 24:59.780
Why is the path to move forward so hard...

25:00.480 --> 25:02.181
for a good person like you?

25:03.421 --> 25:04.320
It is hard indeed.

25:06.351 --> 25:07.250
But don't worry.

25:08.091 --> 25:09.720
I'll take care of this matter.

25:10.260 --> 25:11.460
I won't let you down.

25:12.361 --> 25:13.161
Okay?

25:17.161 --> 25:17.960
Okay.

25:56.341 --> 25:57.141
Stop knocking.

25:59.841 --> 26:00.770
Mr. Gao isn't in?

26:01.411 --> 26:02.141
He is.

26:02.611 --> 26:04.010
But he can't see you now.

26:06.310 --> 26:07.280
We want to talk to him...

26:07.710 --> 26:09.381
before the meeting.

26:10.421 --> 26:12.280
He doesn't want to influence your judgment.

26:12.480 --> 26:13.921
The Investigation Unit is here too.

26:14.050 --> 26:15.490
As your direct leader,

26:15.921 --> 26:17.020
he should avoid suspicion.

26:17.091 --> 26:18.621
Those people even talked to Mr. Gao?

26:19.730 --> 26:20.931
They're quite forceful.

26:22.560 --> 26:23.861
Mr. Gao isn't one who backs down.

26:24.460 --> 26:25.500
I believe that.

26:26.000 --> 26:27.431
He has a message for you.

26:28.201 --> 26:29.970
No matter what decision you two make,

26:30.441 --> 26:31.470
he'll support you.

26:54.131 --> 26:55.260
Listen.

26:56.091 --> 26:57.701
This is not the time to be in the limelight.

26:57.800 --> 26:59.131
What was the cause of the fire?

26:59.631 --> 27:01.000
Who's responsible for what?

27:01.230 --> 27:02.871
The Investigation Unit will get to the bottom of it.

27:02.941 --> 27:04.040
Don't make things hard for yourself.

27:04.540 --> 27:05.871
So I should pretend that I'm mute?

27:06.201 --> 27:07.010
I won't.

27:07.941 --> 27:08.970
Think about yourself.

27:09.210 --> 27:10.681
My late comrade was only 22!

27:10.980 --> 27:12.510
He was also my comrade. It breaks my heart too.

27:12.881 --> 27:14.510
Don't you get it? The nail that sticks out gets hammered down!

27:14.780 --> 27:16.111
That's enough. Cut the crap.

27:16.480 --> 27:17.780
- Sir. - Yes. You're here.

27:19.081 --> 27:19.921
You're all here.

27:37.371 --> 27:38.270
Stop dawdling.

27:39.040 --> 27:40.040
Sit down for the meeting.

27:40.570 --> 27:41.270
Okay.

27:42.510 --> 27:44.341
(Chen Gou He)

27:44.740 --> 27:45.510
This time,

27:46.411 --> 27:47.581
there was a major fire incident.

27:48.280 --> 27:49.451
Three died and ten were injured.

27:50.220 --> 27:51.320
One of our firefighters...

27:52.220 --> 27:53.351
was also killed.

27:54.520 --> 27:56.421
The impact is severe.

27:57.121 --> 27:57.790
Mr. Gao.

27:58.091 --> 27:59.560
Brief us.

27:59.691 --> 28:00.490
Yes, sir.

28:01.391 --> 28:02.460
On February 4th,

28:02.861 --> 28:04.800
at 9:27pm,

28:05.030 --> 28:06.431
the command center...

28:06.530 --> 28:08.101
received an emergency call.

28:08.401 --> 28:10.371
There was a fire at the construction site...

28:10.441 --> 28:11.470
of Junguang Square.

28:11.770 --> 28:13.871
The command center immediately dispatched...

28:14.070 --> 28:15.171
27 fire trucks...

28:15.240 --> 28:16.911
from five fire stations...

28:16.980 --> 28:17.841
to put out the fire.

28:18.181 --> 28:19.411
The first fire truck...

28:19.581 --> 28:21.181
arrived at the scene...

28:21.250 --> 28:22.250
at 9:42 am...

28:22.451 --> 28:23.851
and immediately began to extinguish the fire...

28:23.921 --> 28:25.881
and search for and rescue the trapped.

28:26.020 --> 28:28.651
At around 2:10am on February 5th,

28:29.621 --> 28:30.921
the fire was almost put out.

28:31.060 --> 28:32.361
How did the fire start?

28:33.861 --> 28:34.661
Leaders.

28:35.391 --> 28:37.101
Based on our preliminary investigation,

28:37.401 --> 28:39.030
to celebrate the completion...

28:39.131 --> 28:40.171
of Junguang Square,

28:40.500 --> 28:42.871
they illegally purchased and set off fireworks...

28:42.931 --> 28:44.341
that exceed the standard,

28:44.441 --> 28:46.411
igniting the flammable materials in the building,

28:46.941 --> 28:48.411
thus causing this huge fire.

28:48.871 --> 28:50.040
The main responsibility...

28:50.240 --> 28:52.210
lies on the contractors.

28:52.280 --> 28:53.081
They are the ones...

28:53.181 --> 28:54.381
who caused this huge fire,

28:55.181 --> 28:57.651
resulting in such a huge economic loss...

28:58.020 --> 28:59.480
and loss of lives.

29:01.290 --> 29:02.091
Mr. Chen.

29:03.260 --> 29:04.260
The fireworks...

29:04.520 --> 29:05.921
were just the cause of the fire.

29:06.260 --> 29:07.691
But the fire spread quickly,

29:07.790 --> 29:09.290
causing flashover and collapse.

29:09.361 --> 29:10.560
In such a short time,

29:10.861 --> 29:12.300
it became a three-dimensional combustion.

29:12.500 --> 29:14.030
There must be a problem...

29:14.500 --> 29:15.431
with the building's materials itself.

29:15.601 --> 29:17.341
I'm sure there's nothing wrong with the materials.

29:17.401 --> 29:18.570
They comply with the building design...

29:18.641 --> 29:19.540
and fire codes.

29:19.601 --> 29:21.411
If it's just ordinary materials that caught fire,

29:21.470 --> 29:22.710
how could there be a flashover?

29:22.770 --> 29:24.341
My team couldn't evacuate at all.

29:24.411 --> 29:25.480
Fire situations...

29:25.810 --> 29:26.780
are complicated and variable.

29:27.111 --> 29:28.451
The details of the situation...

29:28.510 --> 29:29.980
are still under investigation.

29:30.780 --> 29:32.381
But one thing is clear.

29:32.651 --> 29:34.290
The fire prevention supervisor of Junguang Square...

29:34.351 --> 29:35.220
did spot checks.

29:35.720 --> 29:37.161
They passed every time.

29:39.891 --> 29:41.131
Which fire station...

29:41.560 --> 29:42.760
was the first to arrive?

29:42.931 --> 29:44.901
Sir, it was Wufang Street Station.

29:45.701 --> 29:46.730
Let me add two things.

29:47.101 --> 29:47.770
First,

29:48.171 --> 29:49.331
the firefighting facilities in the building...

29:49.401 --> 29:50.941
weren't of help.

29:51.000 --> 29:51.701
Second,

29:51.800 --> 29:53.141
there was a lot of smoke at the scene.

29:53.210 --> 29:54.141
It wasn't normal.

29:54.411 --> 29:55.570
Before the flashover,

29:56.010 --> 29:57.881
if it hadn't been for Mr. Song's accurate judgment,

29:59.010 --> 30:00.480
my team and I would have been in mortal danger.

30:04.220 --> 30:05.151
You wrote this report,

30:05.621 --> 30:06.720
didn't you?

30:07.020 --> 30:07.790
Yes.

30:08.320 --> 30:09.250
Tell us...

30:09.391 --> 30:10.490
the content of your report.

30:10.560 --> 30:11.421
Yes.

30:12.161 --> 30:14.161
After the fire broke out at the exterior of the building,

30:14.490 --> 30:15.790
the fire went from the outside in...

30:15.861 --> 30:16.601
and from the bottom up...

30:16.661 --> 30:18.300
until it reached the 12th floor of the building.

30:18.861 --> 30:20.131
It ignited a large quantity...

30:20.201 --> 30:22.070
of substandard insulation piled up in the corridor...

30:22.131 --> 30:23.901
and created a large amount of toxic fumes.

30:24.970 --> 30:26.040
At the scene, I saw...

30:26.240 --> 30:28.341
that the insulation panels were filled with styrofoam,

30:28.671 --> 30:30.681
an obviously substandard insulation material.

30:30.881 --> 30:31.911
That's an important reason...

30:31.980 --> 30:33.510
for the rapid three-dimensional combustion.

30:33.710 --> 30:34.411
Finally,

30:34.710 --> 30:35.550
the construction unit...

30:35.611 --> 30:38.320
stacked and placed all kinds of flammable building materials.

30:38.381 --> 30:39.891
The fire prevention measures on-site...

30:40.851 --> 30:41.820
were in vain.

30:42.320 --> 30:44.560
The impact of the fire is very bad.

30:44.861 --> 30:47.260
The death of a firefighter...

30:47.460 --> 30:48.931
has attracted a lot of attention...

30:49.131 --> 30:50.331
from the public.

30:50.530 --> 30:52.460
We must investigate it as soon as possible,

30:52.530 --> 30:53.500
identify responsibility,

30:53.831 --> 30:54.901
and make a decision...

30:56.101 --> 30:57.141
to answer the public...

30:57.201 --> 30:58.270
as soon as possible,

30:59.240 --> 31:01.441
as well as give an explanation...

31:01.740 --> 31:02.871
to the family of our fallen comrade.

31:03.141 --> 31:04.611
Don't let the wound get wet for a week.

31:05.010 --> 31:06.240
Okay. Thank you, doctor.

31:09.611 --> 31:10.421
Dr. Xu.

31:10.520 --> 31:11.320
What is it?

31:12.250 --> 31:13.651
Those people are back.

31:13.720 --> 31:15.220
They locked the observation room from the inside.

31:15.290 --> 31:17.020
We can't go in to change the patients' wound dressings.

31:36.611 --> 31:37.381
Ms. Meng.

31:37.980 --> 31:38.841
What a coincidence.

31:42.780 --> 31:44.651
I came to see the injured workers.

31:46.381 --> 31:47.591
This is a hospital,

31:47.820 --> 31:48.820
not your office.

31:50.560 --> 31:51.560
Come on.

31:51.921 --> 31:53.391
I'll let you get back to work.

31:53.730 --> 31:54.490
Bye.

31:58.601 --> 31:59.500
Dr. Xu.

31:59.901 --> 32:01.030
What are they up to?

32:01.931 --> 32:02.800
Sorry about that.

32:06.201 --> 32:09.540
- Dr. Xu. - Dr. Xu.

32:15.111 --> 32:16.820
What did the people who came in say?

32:18.181 --> 32:19.181
Nothing much.

32:19.520 --> 32:20.651
They just came to pay a visit.

32:21.050 --> 32:21.921
Impossible.

32:22.151 --> 32:23.591
I heard everything when I leaned against the door.

32:23.661 --> 32:25.020
They said something about compensation.

32:25.490 --> 32:26.931
- They really didn't say anything. - No.

32:26.990 --> 32:28.161
They really didn't.

32:28.560 --> 32:29.730
It's not true.

32:32.060 --> 32:33.230
(Loyal to the party, strict discipline, )

32:33.300 --> 32:34.500
(go through fire and water, be dedicated to the people)

32:40.841 --> 32:42.671
Mr. Song.

32:49.280 --> 32:50.280
Do you have a minute?

32:50.681 --> 32:52.181
I'd like to talk to you in private.

32:59.720 --> 33:00.691
Junguang Square...

33:01.161 --> 33:02.691
is the embodiment of Guokun Group's...

33:02.760 --> 33:04.161
ambitions and dreams.

33:04.530 --> 33:06.730
It's also an important landmark for our city.

33:07.901 --> 33:09.871
Unfortunately, the fire at the construction site...

33:09.931 --> 33:12.270
resulted in seven people with minor injuries,

33:12.341 --> 33:14.270
three seriously injured, and three dead.

33:14.341 --> 33:16.040
One firefighter died in the line of duty.

33:16.371 --> 33:18.441
A city task force has been set up.

33:18.611 --> 33:20.710
The cause of the fire is currently under investigation.

33:21.710 --> 33:22.550
Mrs. Meng.

33:22.710 --> 33:24.220
Do I prepare dinner as usual today?

33:24.881 --> 33:25.550
Yes.

33:39.401 --> 33:41.401
The door is open. Enter.

33:42.901 --> 33:43.671
Mom.

33:46.671 --> 33:47.810
Dad isn't home yet?

33:48.871 --> 33:49.810
He's at the office.

33:50.181 --> 33:51.381
He has been busy lately.

33:52.841 --> 33:53.911
Did he bring his medicine?

33:57.121 --> 33:59.020
If you really care about your dad,

34:00.451 --> 34:02.451
don't get involved with that man.

34:08.191 --> 34:09.530
Mrs. Meng, it's for you.

34:15.500 --> 34:17.400
Madam Fu, this is Wu Yang.

34:18.340 --> 34:19.271
Something happened.

34:19.601 --> 34:21.411
Mr. Meng was taken away for investigation.

34:28.010 --> 34:29.351
Didn't they talk...

34:29.650 --> 34:31.121
to the investigators beforehand?

34:32.150 --> 34:33.621
Something went wrong in between.

34:33.951 --> 34:34.851
Someone reported...

34:35.451 --> 34:36.720
that unqualified insulation materials were used...

34:36.920 --> 34:38.661
in the Junguang Square project.

34:38.990 --> 34:39.860
Who was it?

34:41.391 --> 34:42.331
A firefighter...

34:42.431 --> 34:43.461
by the name of Song Yan.

34:47.831 --> 34:48.670
Okay.

34:49.501 --> 34:50.371
I got it.

34:50.940 --> 34:52.970
Give Mr. Chen a call.

34:53.041 --> 34:54.610
Tell him to arrange work.

34:55.340 --> 34:56.110
Yes.

35:01.181 --> 35:02.150
Your dad...

35:03.780 --> 35:05.081
has been taken away for investigation.

35:08.451 --> 35:09.720
Is it because of the fire?

35:11.490 --> 35:14.291
Someone reported something to the task force.

35:17.331 --> 35:18.561
He wants to bring us down.

35:19.360 --> 35:20.431
It won't be that easy.

35:31.340 --> 35:32.110
Let's eat.

35:34.311 --> 35:35.081
Mom.

35:36.380 --> 35:37.280
I don't have an appetite.

35:37.720 --> 35:38.481
Why?

35:39.081 --> 35:40.121
The dishes at home...

35:41.451 --> 35:43.090
don't suit your taste anymore?

35:48.061 --> 35:49.360
Your boyfriend...

35:50.701 --> 35:52.630
is very capable.

35:54.300 --> 35:55.970
He has a responsibility to fulfill.

35:56.300 --> 35:57.001
Is that so?

35:58.041 --> 35:59.271
Is it a responsibility to fulfill?

35:59.771 --> 36:00.670
Or is it...

36:01.271 --> 36:03.010
that he doesn't care about your feelings...

36:03.740 --> 36:05.041
and your family?

36:06.311 --> 36:07.380
He knows...

36:07.711 --> 36:09.081
that we don't like him.

36:09.411 --> 36:11.280
But he never thought about easing the tension.

36:12.920 --> 36:14.521
Instead, he's doing this.

36:15.121 --> 36:16.291
Adding fuel to the fire.

36:18.360 --> 36:20.731
Maybe he doesn't care about you at all.

36:22.891 --> 36:23.760
Mom.

36:25.231 --> 36:26.501
I just thought about it.

36:28.030 --> 36:29.570
Guokun is a big company.

36:30.400 --> 36:32.300
Junguang is just one of the projects.

36:32.771 --> 36:34.670
There's a dedicated project team and person in charge.

36:36.340 --> 36:37.880
I don't think it has much relation with Dad.

36:38.681 --> 36:40.451
Dad is just cooperating with the investigation.

36:40.681 --> 36:41.481
You don't have...

36:41.681 --> 36:43.081
to scare her like that.

36:43.311 --> 36:44.621
The person in charge of Junguang...

36:44.920 --> 36:46.251
is Mr. Gu.

36:46.550 --> 36:47.920
If he's affected,

36:48.090 --> 36:50.720
your dad's influence in the group...

36:51.260 --> 36:52.990
will be greatly damaged.

36:53.360 --> 36:54.130
Mom.

36:55.661 --> 36:56.831
Three people died.

36:58.501 --> 37:00.300
And what you care about now is power?

37:05.201 --> 37:06.070
Let's eat.

37:21.021 --> 37:23.021
The higher-ups are taking your report seriously.

37:23.351 --> 37:24.621
There will surely be...

37:24.690 --> 37:26.260
a fair investigation result.

37:44.880 --> 37:45.780
Ms. Meng.

37:57.220 --> 37:58.061
Madam Fu.

37:58.320 --> 37:59.420
I've looked into it.

38:00.161 --> 38:01.490
The fireworks were set off illegally.

38:01.690 --> 38:02.990
The project manager, Zhao Cheng Xin,

38:03.061 --> 38:04.001
acted on his own.

38:04.601 --> 38:06.030
He took a kickback from the fireworks factory.

38:07.130 --> 38:08.030
Mr. Gu...

38:08.300 --> 38:09.771
didn't know about this.

38:10.970 --> 38:11.701
Secondly,

38:12.641 --> 38:13.610
the fire inspection at the site...

38:13.670 --> 38:14.970
failed several times.

38:15.641 --> 38:16.871
It affected the construction progress.

38:17.740 --> 38:19.141
In the end, it was Zhao Cheng Xin...

38:19.211 --> 38:21.010
who took some unconventional measures...

38:21.311 --> 38:22.411
to get the permit.

38:24.380 --> 38:25.820
These are problems...

38:25.880 --> 38:27.121
between the Project Department and Zhao Cheng Xin.

38:27.521 --> 38:28.891
It has little to do with the group.

38:29.150 --> 38:30.360
Mr. Gu didn't know about it either.

38:31.090 --> 38:32.461
But he's bound to be implicated.

38:35.990 --> 38:36.791
What else?

38:37.001 --> 38:38.030
The focus of the investigation...

38:38.101 --> 38:39.161
is the insulation material.

38:40.130 --> 38:41.501
Song Yan reported that Junguang...

38:41.570 --> 38:43.001
used substandard materials...

38:43.431 --> 38:44.800
which caused the fire to get serious.

38:46.800 --> 38:48.871
So was there a problem with the materials?

38:50.280 --> 38:51.840
Mr. Wang who works for Mr Gu said...

38:52.110 --> 38:53.880
the materials definitely meet the criteria.

38:54.581 --> 38:56.481
But Mr. Wang didn't do the check himself.

38:56.981 --> 38:58.181
Therefore, I can't guarantee...

38:58.380 --> 38:59.220
the reliability.

39:02.291 --> 39:03.291
In the end,

39:03.760 --> 39:04.920
the problem...

39:05.220 --> 39:06.720
is Mr. Gu's subordinate.

39:07.490 --> 39:08.661
Mr. Wang...

39:09.190 --> 39:10.760
should take care of the aftermath.

39:11.001 --> 39:13.161
They should bear the responsibility.

39:14.701 --> 39:15.970
You only need...

39:17.601 --> 39:18.970
to give Mr. Wang a reminder.

39:19.201 --> 39:20.970
Don't worry, I understand.

39:27.880 --> 39:29.081
Thank you for your hard work.

39:29.251 --> 39:30.181
You came all the way here.

39:30.251 --> 39:31.581
Slow down. Watch your step.

39:32.720 --> 39:33.521
They're all here.

39:38.561 --> 39:39.720
Yes. Here too.

39:44.931 --> 39:45.900
I swear.

39:46.360 --> 39:47.501
The insulation material we use...

39:47.570 --> 39:48.630
is grade B1.

39:48.701 --> 39:50.900
There's absolutely nothing that's not up to scratch.

39:51.070 --> 39:51.800
Look.

39:52.101 --> 39:53.501
Such good materials burned to a crisp.

39:53.570 --> 39:54.541
What a waste.

39:55.411 --> 39:57.081
Are all the materials here?

39:57.440 --> 39:58.440
Why are the other floors...

39:58.780 --> 39:59.581
all clean?

40:00.510 --> 40:01.851
How would I know?

40:01.911 --> 40:03.050
The firefighters cleaned it up.

40:03.110 --> 40:04.081
We didn't touch anything.

40:04.581 --> 40:05.751
The firefighters...

40:05.820 --> 40:06.880
would protect the scene.

40:07.150 --> 40:09.121
They couldn't have cleaned up so well.

40:10.150 --> 40:11.161
That's common sense.

40:12.260 --> 40:13.090
Come on.

40:13.161 --> 40:14.461
I don't know about that.

40:14.661 --> 40:16.291
But ever since the fire was put out,

40:16.360 --> 40:17.731
this place has been sealed.

40:17.860 --> 40:19.431
Not even a stray cat has been let in.

40:19.501 --> 40:20.970
It's true. I swear to you.

40:24.400 --> 40:25.240
Here.

40:26.041 --> 40:27.510
There's a CCTV, right?

40:30.070 --> 40:31.510
The lines were all blown.

40:31.581 --> 40:32.610
The cameras are broken.

40:33.010 --> 40:34.481
We're about to install new ones.

40:36.581 --> 40:37.720
Take pictures.

40:38.081 --> 40:38.880
They're all grade B1.

40:43.891 --> 40:45.320
(Tea)

40:55.931 --> 40:57.170
Hello, Mr. Song.

40:58.900 --> 41:00.740
I have an important document to give to you.

41:01.070 --> 41:01.911
What is it?

41:01.970 --> 41:03.610
It's about the fire at Junguang Square.

41:03.811 --> 41:04.610
It's very important.

41:07.181 --> 41:08.110
If there's anything you want to report,

41:08.481 --> 41:09.510
you can go directly to the station.

41:10.380 --> 41:11.380
I can't go there.

41:11.451 --> 41:12.380
I'm afraid I'd be followed.

41:14.291 --> 41:15.420
I can call the police for you.

41:19.720 --> 41:20.590
You don't believe me?

41:20.661 --> 41:22.090
Forget it if you don't.

41:28.170 --> 41:28.970
Come back!
